Wait — in mapReceipt I have a bug: I read facilityId then destinationVersion, then check `rs.wasNull()` twice — wasNull() refers to the LAST read column. I read facilityId (getLong), then destinationVersion (getInt) — wasNull() after that refers to destination_version. I need to check wasNull immediately after each read. Fix:

```java
long facilityId = rs.getLong("facility_id");
Long facilityIdBoxed = rs.wasNull() ? null : facilityId;
int destinationVersion = rs.getInt("destination_version");
